# The Vite bundle, written here by `npm run build` in `server/frontend`
# (its `build.outDir`). Never committed: it is a build artefact of source that
# already lives in this repo, it is rewritten wholesale on every build, and the
# Docker image builds it in its own node stage (web-and-households ticket 09).
# `web.views.spa_index` refusing in words when it is absent is what makes a
# checkout without it a clear message rather than a stack trace.
static/app/

# `collectstatic`'s output. Generated at image build time, same reasoning.
staticfiles/
